   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Oh my, what an interesting mod idea! I will definitely be using this. Question for even more immersion, do you include a faction for \u201cbase weight\u201d, like for the container itself? I.E the bag of a Salewa would still weight a bit even at 1/400 resource.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
