   "created_at": "2025-10-08T20:13:48+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Yes, I do. I configured it for every item manually: <a href=\"https://github.com/Tosox/SPT-DynamicItemWeights/blob/master/emptyweights.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/Tosox/SPT-DynamicItemWeights/blob/master/emptyweights.json</a>. I also added a default fall back which can be edited in the in-game configuration settings :)</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
